{"id":"651671","name":"蛎肉拌马齿苋","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/651671/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牡蛎肉","amount":"100g"},{"name":"马齿苋","amount":"200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"白虾","amount":"2个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"马齿苋洗净。","img":"images/651671/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅烧开水。","img":"images/651671/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放马齿苋焯水。","img":"images/651671/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煮开锅捞出过冷水。","img":"images/651671/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"蛎肉冷水下锅。","img":"images/651671/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"马齿苋撰干水分，两个白虾煮熟去壳。","img":"images/651671/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"蛎肉煮开锅即可。","img":"images/651671/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"捞出蛎肉放野菜里。","img":"images/651671/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放食盐和鸡精。","img":"images/651671/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"大蒜处理干净切末放进来，加陈醋。","img":"images/651671/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/651671/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/651671/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}